<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an English premier league soccer match on Monday:</p>
<p>Arsenal 4 (David Platt 57th min, Ian Wright 61st penalty, 78th, 89th) Sheffield Wednesday 1 (Andy Booth 25th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance: 33,461.</p>
